      "value": "@{5f2a4df969e04460cfc5e29d|full_name}: Don't confuse recording with streaming, though. Plenty of us record to keep precious memories to rewatch later and never intend to share. On the other hand, with streaming, there is an explicit thrusting of everyone in frame into the public eye, like turning a live television camera onto a scene IRL.",
